---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
const schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'ContactPage',name:'Partner with ATRS Engineering',url:'https://atrseng.co.ke/partner/'};
---
<Base title="Partner with ATRS" description="Partner with ATRS Engineering Consultants for traffic engineering, road safety, BRT, mobility and transport data assignments." schema={schema}>
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Partner with ATRS</span><h1>Bring the right traffic and safety expertise into the team.</h1><p>ATRS can support project owners, engineering teams, transport agencies and delivery partners where traffic, safety, public transport or mobility analysis is required.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="grid"><article class="card"><Icon name="partner"/><span class="pill">Consulting teams</span><h3>Technical teaming</h3><p>Bring traffic and road safety expertise into multidisciplinary bids, designs and implementation teams.</p></article><article class="card"><Icon name="project"/><span class="pill">Project owners</span><h3>Independent support</h3><p>Commission targeted studies or technical inputs around traffic, access, safety, operations or mobility.</p></article><article class="card"><Icon name="transport"/><span class="pill">Public sector</span><h3>Transport programmes</h3><p>Support corridor, public transport, road safety and traffic management programmes with structured evidence and analysis.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container split"><div><span class="tag">What to send</span><h2>Make the first conversation useful.</h2><ul><li>Project or tender name</li><li>Location and project type</li><li>Required technical scope</li><li>Known programme or deadline</li><li>Available drawings, surveys or terms of reference</li></ul></div><div class="feature-box"><div class="icon-row"><Icon name="partner"/><span class="eyebrow">Next step</span></div><h3 style="font-size:2rem">Send the brief.</h3><p>We can review the requirement and identify the most appropriate technical support.</p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact/">Contact ATRS →</a></div></div></section>
</Base>